sequenceDiagram
    participant usecase as Home Core / home-control
    participant connector as Simulated Zigbee Connector
    participant transport as Simulated Transport
    participant mesh as Virtual Zigbee Mesh
    usecase->>connector: Execute(roomId, turn_on, idempotencyKey)
    connector->>transport: Resolve devices and send commands
    transport->>mesh: Deliver command per device
    alt device reachable
        mesh-->>transport: Observed state
        transport-->>connector: Confirmed DeviceState
        connector-->>usecase: CommandResult executed
    else route or device unavailable
        mesh-->>transport: Transport error
        transport-->>connector: unavailable / failed
        connector-->>usecase: Result without false success
    end
